{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00242","headline":"唐大飨拜洛乐章 咸和 · 则天皇后","name":"唐大飨拜洛乐章 咸和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坎泽祠容备举，坤坛祭典爰申。\n灵睠遥行秘躅，嘉贶荐委殊珍。\n肃礼恭禋载展，翘襟邈志逾殷。\n方期交际悬应。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"则天皇后","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}